<!--
    A sheet of the plan with a plus at its corner: the schedule written rather than read.
    The pair to the eye beside it in the same menu, and drawn by hand as the eye is.

    Not the pencil the trip is edited with, which stands two inches away in the bar above
    and means something else: that one changes one record, this one changes what the whole
    tab is for. The plus is the difference a person actually sees on switching — the empty
    hours turn into places to put something.
-->
